{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":47170708,"ns":0,"title":"Autonomous aircraft","extract":"An autonomous aircraft is an aircraft which flies under the control of on-board autonomous robotic systems and needs no intervention from a human pilot or remote control. Most contemporary autonomous aircraft are unmanned aerial vehicles (drones) with pre-programmed algorithms to perform designated tasks, but advancements in artificial intelligence technologies (e.g.","description":"Aircraft which flies without a human pilot","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}